---
title: Breadcrumb
description: Where am I. An ordered list of links in a labelled nav, the last one marked as the current page. With icons, as icons only, as chips, and collapsed for a long trail.
eyebrow: Navigation
source: src/components/wayfinding.css
---
<h2>Default</h2>
{{#example}}
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="im-breadcrumb">
	<li><a href="#default">Home</a></li><li><a href="#default">Journal</a></li><li><a href="#default">Travel</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">Driving the Amalfi Coast</span></li>
</ol></nav>
{{/example}}
<p>The separators are CSS, so a screen reader hears only the names. The last item is <code>aria-current="page"</code> and is not a link.</p>

<h2>With icons</h2>
{{#example}}
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="im-breadcrumb im-breadcrumb-chevron">
	<li><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5" href="#with-icons">{{> "icons/house"}} Home</a></li>
	<li><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5" href="#with-icons">{{> "icons/book-open"}} Journal</a></li>
	<li><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5" href="#with-icons">{{> "icons/map-pin"}} Travel</a></li>
	<li><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5" aria-current="page">{{> "icons/file-text"}} Driving the Amalfi Coast</span></li>
</ol></nav>
{{/example}}

<h2>Icons only</h2>
<p>For a tight header. Every icon link keeps a text name — in <code>aria-label</code>, and as a <a href="/components/tooltip/">tooltip</a>.</p>
{{#example}}
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="im-breadcrumb im-breadcrumb-chevron">
	<li><a href="#icons-only" aria-label="Home" data-im-tip="Home">{{> "icons/house"}}</a></li>
	<li><a href="#icons-only" aria-label="Journal" data-im-tip="Journal">{{> "icons/book-open"}}</a></li>
	<li><a href="#icons-only" aria-label="Travel" data-im-tip="Travel">{{> "icons/map-pin"}}</a></li>
	<li><span aria-current="page">Driving the Amalfi Coast</span></li>
</ol></nav>
{{/example}}
{{#example title="Just the home icon — the most common form"}}
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="im-breadcrumb">
	<li><a href="#icons-only" aria-label="Home">{{> "icons/house"}}</a></li><li><a href="#icons-only">Components</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">Breadcrumb</span></li>
</ol></nav>
{{/example}}

<h2>Separators</h2>
{{#example}}
<div class="im-stack im-stack-sm">
	<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb, slash"><ol class="im-breadcrumb"><li><a href="#separators">Home</a></li><li><a href="#separators">Docs</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">Slash (default)</span></li></ol></nav>
	<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb, chevron"><ol class="im-breadcrumb im-breadcrumb-chevron"><li><a href="#separators">Home</a></li><li><a href="#separators">Docs</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">im-breadcrumb-chevron</span></li></ol></nav>
	<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb, dot"><ol class="im-breadcrumb im-breadcrumb-dot"><li><a href="#separators">Home</a></li><li><a href="#separators">Docs</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">im-breadcrumb-dot</span></li></ol></nav>
</div>
{{/example}}

<h2>Chips</h2>
{{#example}}
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="im-breadcrumb im-breadcrumb-chips">
	<li><a href="#chips">{{> "icons/house"}} Home</a></li><li><a href="#chips">Journal</a></li><li><a href="#chips">Travel</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">Amalfi</span></li>
</ol></nav>
{{/example}}

<h2>A long trail</h2>
<p>Collapse the middle into a <a href="/navigation/menu/">menu</a>, and keep the first and the last two.</p>
{{#example}}
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="im-breadcrumb im-breadcrumb-chevron">
	<li><a href="#a-long-trail" aria-label="Home">{{> "icons/house"}}</a></li>
	<li><button class="im-btn im-btn-ghost im-btn-icon im-btn-sm" type="button" popovertarget="crumb-more" aria-label="Show 3 more levels" aria-expanded="false">{{> "icons/ellipsis"}}</button>
		<div class="im-menu" id="crumb-more" popover data-align="start"><a class="im-menu-item" href="#a-long-trail">{{> "icons/folder"}}<span>Courses</span></a><a class="im-menu-item" href="#a-long-trail">{{> "icons/folder"}}<span>Design systems</span></a><a class="im-menu-item" href="#a-long-trail">{{> "icons/folder"}}<span>Module 2</span></a></div></li>
	<li><a href="#a-long-trail">Tokens</a></li>
	<li><span aria-current="page">Semantic tokens</span></li>
</ol></nav>
{{/example}}
<p>On a phone, <code>im-breadcrumb-scroll</code> keeps a trail on one line and lets it scroll sideways, rather than wrapping to three.</p>

<h2>In Ghost</h2>
{{{{code "hbs"}}}}
<nav aria-label="{{t "Breadcrumb"}}">
	<ol class="im-breadcrumb im-breadcrumb-chevron">
		<li><a href="{{@site.url}}" aria-label="{{t "Home"}}">{{> "icons/house"}}</a></li>
		{{#primary_tag}}<li><a href="{{url}}">{{name}}</a></li>{{/primary_tag}}
		<li><span aria-current="page">{{title}}</span></li>
	</ol>
</nav>
{{{{/code}}}}
